; The <Ability:ClassName> can yank an adult human into its coils from far away.
[M31_PA_GetOverHere X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Tongue Grab"
LocLongDescription="Grab a target with your tongue and pull them to melee range for the bind. Has a minimum range of <Ability:M31_PA_GetOverHere_MinRange> tiles and a maximum range of <Ability:M31_PA_GetOverHere_MaxRange> tiles. Certain enemies, like Custodians, cannot be pulled."
LocHelpText="Grab a target with your tongue and pull them to melee range. Only humanoid targets can be pulled."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> Bind deals <Ability:M31_PA_BindCrush_Damage> damage. Damage increases the longer the unit is bound.<br><Bullet> Cannot be used while <Ability:ClassName> is suppressed.<br><Bullet> Has a <Ability:M31_SelfCooldown> turn cooldown."
LocFlyOverText="Tongue Grab"
LocMissMessage="Grab Failed!"

[M31_PA_GetOverHereAlly X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Tongue Pull"
LocLongDescription="Grab an ally with your tongue and pull them to melee range. Has a minimum range of <Ability:M31_PA_GetOverHereAlly_MinRange> tiles and a maximum range of <Ability:M31_PA_GetOverHereAlly_MaxRange> tiles."
LocHelpText="Grab an ally with your tongue and pull them to melee range. Only humanoid targets can be pulled."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> Cannot be used while <Ability:ClassName> is suppressed.<br><Bullet> Has a <Ability:M31_SelfCooldown> turn cooldown.<br><Bullet> Does not break concealment."
LocFlyOverText="Tongue Pull"
LocMissMessage="How did that happen?"

